// Dialog - DoormanIntro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2009954004" "I see Mistress Eva has found someone after all. Good, for it is not just the people of <i>Nowhere</i> that need your help, the Carnival of Light believes we are all in danger.<br><br>I know you would not have come here if you did not wish to help these people, but in order to do so you must understand what it is you will be facing.<br><br>Speak with me if you are ready to learn the truth which so many Praetorians do not know."
// Answer Text :
"P591590492" "Very well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DoormanClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3101529242" "The Doorman"
// DetailString :
"P2341600662" "Mistress Eva told you about a man in the underground of Praetoria's Imperial City. He is known only as The Doorman.<br><br><i>He guards the door to Nowhere</i>, she said.<br><br>If you are going to help the people of Nowhere, you will have to see The Doorman to find your way to The First Ward."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P200578471" "This magical portal links our two worlds together. <color orange>It will take you to the underground of Praetoria's Imperial City where you must speak to Doorman</color>, he guards the door to <color orange>Nowhere</color>. You are sorely needed by the people of Nowhere.<br><br>Will you be a champion of Nowhere, or let them remain forgotten?"
// AcceptString :
"P2412454191" "I'll help if I can, but this is all very strange."
// SendOffString :
"P4126627871" "Worry not, brave hero. <i>Nowhere</i> is a real place, with real people, in real peril. It is the place that people find themselves when they no longer fit in Cole's carefully orchestrated order. They are taken to <i>Nowhere</i>; also known as <color orange>The First Ward</color>; where no one lives, but everyone suffers."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2959590604" "Cross Dimensions and talk to The Doorman"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1875363638" "Only The Doorman can grant you access to Praetoria's First Ward. You can find him on the other side of this magical portal to Praetoria in the Imperial City underground."

